00:36:02,180 --> 00:36:06,180
He created a program to divide computer messages into packets.

423
00:36:06,181 --> 00:36:11,180
As a graduate student at MIT, I looked around me and I saw these computers.

424
00:36:11,181 --> 00:36:14,180
There were lots of them, but they were not able to talk to each other.

425
00:36:14,181 --> 00:36:19,180
